r et flerkulturelt fellesskap i Norge!”","fact_ids":"cfafe4dcbc3f352d8db5b11f"},{"position":2,"kind":"what_it_does","text":"Registered activity: Frivillig, ideell og flerkulturell organisasjon som arbeider for inkluderende fellesskap og deltakelse på tvers av kultur og bakgrunn. Gjennom møteplasser, språktrening, kvalifisering, frivillighet og diakonalt arbeid styrker vi deltakelse i arbeidsliv og lokalsamfunn. Arbeidet u.","fact_ids":"93fed453990a8f84ee14b638"},{"position":3,"kind":"financials","text":"Latest filed accounts (2025-01-01 to 2025-12-31, company accounts): revenue NOK 25.2 m, operating result NOK -1.5 m, net result NOK 421.3 k, total assets NOK 7.4 m, equity NOK 884.8 k. The period closed with a profit.","fact_ids":"099e715851cfba4b994f253a|e8f6bf57460759271b59f0a5|14b48ef4e6b66b5f190e0267|bb78694993d8c131181ff18d|eba86161385dd7b57aa69b82"},{"position":4,"kind":"financial_change","text":"Change from 2024 to 2025: revenue went from NOK 27.0 m to NOK 25.2 m (-7%); net result went from NOK 96.0 k to NOK 421.3 k (+339%); equity went from NOK 463.5 k to NOK 884.8 k (+91%).","fact_ids":"099e715851cfba4b994f253a|a38a856c4f633d85ffde8fb6|14b48ef4e6b66b5f190e0267|369cd215cac768c96279f3ec|eba86161385dd7b57aa69b82|c46d4a3a0a047dc40daa39b8"},{"position":5,"kind":"financial_health","text":"Financial position in 2025: operating margin -5.8%; equity ratio 11.9%. Calculated from the filed figures above.","fact_ids":"099e715851cfba4b994f253a|e8f6bf57460759271b59f0a5|eba86161385dd7b57aa69b82|bb78694993d8c131181ff18d"},{"position":6,"kind":"size","text":"Registered employees: 54.","fact_ids":"d855dc7eb7f4baca26a08572"},{"position":7,"kind":"leadership","text":"Leadership in the official register: Ruth Marie Salte Keyes (managing director); Victor Robert Calvert (chair of the board); Reidar Andestad (board member); Nyagoa William Nyuon (board member); plus 5 further roles.","fact_ids":"284b1d5cacdec067f27809ae|6b5aba80ba655ec782a8cab8|e96ae7d15cccb7179edac6c8|6a42c73d1ad3